  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "In the frame (inertial w.r.t. earth) of the free end of spring, the initial velocity of the block is <math><mn>3&nbsp;</mn><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mo>/</mo><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></mrow></mrow></math> to left and the spring is unstretched.<br /><br /><br /><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image40-bbd67ba3-e913-4af6-ab83-564b57876558.jpg\" /><br /><br />Applying conservation of energy between initial and maximum extension state,<br /><br /><math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math><br /><br /><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">k</mi></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">V</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mrow><mn>4</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>10000</mn></mrow></mfrac></msqrt><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&nbsp;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi></math>&nbsp;",
